    "equipment": [],
    "notes": "Statistics describe an average Ithorian; to create a player character add 6D to the given stats. Speak Basic with a peculiar stereo twist; their native tongue is one of the most difficult to speak. Most train in agricultural, artistic, diplomatic, mercantile or spacefaring fields; some become ecological priests of the \"Mother Jungle\". Herds are autonomous and communal, gathering every five years for the Meet. Space herds trade with both Empire and Alliance and wish to avoid trouble; starfaring herds carry deflector shields and weapons against pirates but are no match for Imperial warships. A stormtrooper garrison has recently been deposited on Ithor.",
    "book": "sourcebook"
